<h1>沿用原版鸡宝，调整桌面图标</h1>
<p>保留探头姿势、小毛和张嘴表情，简化背景装饰。</p>
<section class="comparison" aria-label="图标对照">
<article><h2>原版</h2><div class="icon original"><img src="/assets/png/icon.png" alt="原版鸡宝厨房图标"></div><small>原始完整图标</small></article>
<article><h2>修改前</h2><div class="icon circle" id="previous"></div><small>旧图标 · 圆形裁切</small></article>
<article><h2>修改后</h2><div class="icon circle"><img src="/web/art/app-icon-v2.png" alt="新版圆形图标"></div><small>沿用原版角色特征</small></article>
</section>
<section class="detail"><h2>小尺寸与不同外形</h2>
<div class="samples">
<div class="sample"><div class="icon circle" style="--size:48px"><img src="/web/art/app-icon-v2.png" alt="48像素圆形"></div><p>48 · 圆形</p></div>
<div class="sample"><div class="icon" style="--size:48px"><img src="/web/art/app-icon-v2.png" alt="48像素圆角方形"></div><p>48 · 圆角</p></div>
<div class="sample"><div class="icon circle" style="--size:72px"><img src="/web/art/app-icon-v2.png" alt="72像素圆形"></div><p>72 · 圆形</p></div>
<div class="sample"><div class="icon" style="--size:72px"><img src="/web/art/app-icon-v2.png" alt="72像素圆角方形"></div><p>72 · 圆角</p></div>
<div class="sample"><div class="icon circle" style="--size:72px;background:#dce8d7" id="monochrome"></div><p>单色主题</p></div>
</div></section>
<p class="note">此页模拟图标外形与尺寸；手机桌面的最终遮罩由系统决定。原作素材保留，通知图标独立。</p>
</main>
